    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/18-otomy-avenue-clane-kildare-w91x725\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 18 Ottomy Avenue, Clane in Kildare.\r\n\r\nNestled in the serene landscape of Clane, Kildare, 18 Ottomy Avenue is a charming detached residence that promises both comfort and potential. Upon arrival, the property impresses with its traditional architectural style, featuring a well-maintained façade and a neatly presented front lawn, complemented by established shrubs. The house also boasts a convenient driveway, ensuring ample parking space for residents.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is cleverly configured to maximise space and natural light. The inviting living room offers generous proportions, creating a comfortable setting for everyday relaxation. Adjacent to this, the kitchen is a bright and functional space, with plenty of room for dining and direct access towards the rear of the property. A separate laundry room adds further practicality, while a ground-floor bathroom provides added convenience.\r\n\r\nAlso positioned on the ground floor is a well-proportioned bedroom, offering excellent flexibility for family living, guests, or use as a home office depending on the needs of the purchaser. Upstairs, the property includes two further bedrooms, each offering comfortable accommodation and natural light. A family bathroom and additional closet storage complete this level, adding to the overall practicality of the home.\r\n\r\nThe property also includes a sizeable rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space and potential for an extension, subject to planning permission. This adds further appeal for buyers seeking a home with scope to grow or adapt over time.\r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance of Clane's local schools, sports clubs, and community amenities, the home is well-positioned for easy access to public transport options and major road networks, connecting residents to nearby towns and Dublin city.\r\n\r\nThis property presents an appealing opportunity for first-time buyers or families seeking a spacious residence with potential for personalisation. Its convenient location and practical layout make it a strong choice for those looking to enjoy the tranquillity of suburban living while retaining easy access to urban amenities."
      },
